WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.412
The remaining fixes lean more on people.

2
00:00:02.412 --> 00:00:05.459
An account that matches
nobody goes to its owner,

3
00:00:05.459 --> 00:00:08.200
who correlates it to a
person or disables it.

4
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.213
The same person twice is
a correlation-rule change,

5
00:00:11.213 --> 00:00:15.375
and SailPoint notes that it supports
some mover cases only partially.

6
00:00:15.375 --> 00:00:19.100
Contractors come from a separate
source, corrected by the sponsor.

7
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:23.691
SailPoint says its Non-Employee Risk
Management product is inside the FedRAMP

8
00:00:23.691 --> 00:00:27.448
authorization, but confirm that
from the authorization package,

9
00:00:27.448 --> 00:00:28.700
not the press release.

10
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:31.637
A rule that derives the
wrong access surfaces in

11
00:00:31.637 --> 00:00:34.575
a certification and goes
to the governance body.

12
00:00:34.575 --> 00:00:39.475
And a credential that outlives the person
sits outside both products entirely.

13
00:00:39.475 --> 00:00:41.620
Next, federal availability.
